prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, and the welfare of the minor {minor_name} being the paramount consideration, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Appoint the Petitioner as the guardian of the person {and/or property} of the minor {minor_name}, son/daughter of {parent_names}, born on {minor_dob}, under the Guardians and Wards Act, 1890 {and / or the Hindu Minority and Guardianship Act, 1956};
b) Grant custody of the minor to the Petitioner;
c) Grant interim custody to the Petitioner pending final disposal of this petition;
d) Direct the Respondent to hand over the minor's documents, school records and personal effects to the Petitioner;
e) Award costs of this petition;
f) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper having regard to the welfare of the minor.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
